# Allowlist (TASK-021): send nothing to the Docker build except what the API image copies.
# Never data/ (NEU images, ADR-015), .env (secrets), results/, mlruns/ or other model files.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/__init__.py
!src/config.py
!src/db/
!src/serving/
!configs/params.yaml
!models/serving/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
